		(at 332.97 132.93 90)
		(descr "hanxia HX PZ2.54-1x10P TP-YQ: 1x10 2.54 mm vertical pin header, surface mount, staggered feet, Type A (YQ: odd pins' feet one side, even pins' the other). From the banked drawing (datasheets/connectors/HANXIA-HX-PZ2.54-1x10P-TP-YQ.pdf): insulator 2.50 high and 2.54 wide, posts 3.20 above it, feet 5.00 +/- 0.25 across; recommended pads 1.02 x 3.20 at 6.40 outside, here 1.02 x 2.80 at 6.00 outside (each pad 0.20 shorter at its toe, still 0.25 past the longest foot) so the 5V..IO1 row keeps the Matrix carrier's edge clearance from its USB-C notch")
