		(at 329.255 138.615 90)
		(descr "XKB Connection X1270WR-2x12A-9TV01: 2x12 1.27 mm shrouded box header, right-angle, through-hole, keyed. From the banked drawing rev A1 (datasheets/connectors/XKB-X1270WR-2x12A-9TV01.pdf): 0.70 holes on a 1.27 grid, body C 21.54 long and 5.40 deep, the far (odd, upper) tail row 2.60 behind the body's back, the near (even) row 1.27 in front of it; mouth at +x. Pads 1.50 x 1.07 with the hole 0.215 off centre, lengthened away from the other row, as the J-CHAIN header's. Courtyard 0.25 round the insulator and, behind it, round the pad rows only, which are 15.04 long against its 21.54 (2026-10-03: J-MCU-KB stands with its pad rows beside the right-hand key board's tail column)")
